  "title": "The Time-Course of Food Representation in the Human Brain",
  "description": "This dataset contains raw EEG recordings, organized in BIDS format, collected to study the time-course of food representation in the human brain. It supports analyses of how neural responses to food stimuli unfold over time. Code, figures and the associated manuscript are available through linked resources.",
  "methods_description": "EEG data were collected and organized according to the Brain Imaging Data Structure (BIDS) standard. Analysis code and associated figures are available through the Open Science Framework.",
